 7. 📉 New poll: Young Americans sour on future 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: American University poll. Chart: Erin Davis/Axios Visuals Younger adults are just half as likely to feel prouder of "where America is heading as a nation" (29%) compared with "what America has been in the past" (59%) , Axios' Margaret Talev writes from a new poll by the Sine Institute of Policy and Politics at American University conducted by the Generation Lab. 

